DOMAIN: Testing & Quality Gates
FILES: tests/, scripts/run_integration_tests.py, scripts/scale_test.py, scripts/load_test.py
ENTRY: uv run pytest tests/ (unit), scripts/run_integration_tests.py (integration)

TEST CATEGORIES:
- Unit tests: tests/test_*.py — 38 test files covering all major modules
- Integration tests: scripts/run_integration_tests.py (requires running stack on localhost:8000)
- Scale tests: scripts/scale_test.py (provisions N source DBs, generates events)
- Load tests: scripts/load_test.py, examples/sandbox/load_test.py
- Container smoke tests: scripts/check_container_readyz.py

KEY TEST FILES:
- test_event_pipeline.py — pipeline filtering/transformation
- test_event_parser.py — payload parsing
- test_routes.py — API endpoint contracts
- test_auth_service.py — authentication flows
- test_provisioning.py — provisioning step execution
- test_schema_discovery.py — schema upsert logic
- test_consumer_service.py — consumer processing
- test_retention.py — cleanup and partition management
- test_migration_locking.py — concurrent migration safety
- test_cursor_indexes.py — pagination index verification
- test_package_*.py — namespace/packaging validation
- conftest.py — shared fixtures (test DB sessions, mock factories)

MAKEFILE TARGETS:
- make monitor-test — unit tests via uv
- make monitor-test-integration — integration tests
- make monitor-lint — ruff lint
- make monitor-typecheck — mypy type checking
- make monitor-test-package — packaging smoke tests
- make monitor-test-scale-target — scale validation

PITFALLS:
- Integration tests require the full stack (Postgres + Kafka + app) running
- Scale tests generate real events — clean up after running
- conftest.py provides AsyncSessionLocal fixtures for test isolation
